close_comment = "The retained HTTP regression still uses the globally mocked fetch, so it cannot prove real upstream status handling and stats metadata behavior. A focused follow-up will restore real loopback requests with mock restoration and qualify the HTTP regression alongside the fetch import-boundary tests."

